#==============================================================================================
#
#   document_loading_1 - loading XML, HTML and text documents for a navigation
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/DOM/DocumentLoading.cpp (lines 40-302): converting a document into an
#       XML error document, building XML documents, and the HTML, XML and text loaders. The
#       C++ lambdas become capture structs with static `call` functions, wrapped in GC
#       functions as in the donor.
